WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.450
In your account, open Domains, and choose the domain you want to point somewhere else.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.434
Replace the nameservers with the ones you were given.

3
00:00:09.434 --> 00:00:21.750
You can use two, or add more if your provider lists them.

4
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:26.650
Then click Save nameservers.

5
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:31.352
Changes usually work within a few hours, and up to a day worldwide.
